  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With manual sync, it should be possible to SetOwner -> RequestSerialization and have all players see the change. However, if OnOwnershipRequest is implemented, then a call to RequestSerialization right after SetOwner won't show up for any other players. Instead, you would need to delay the request by some amount of time for all other players to process the request first. This feels at best very unintuitive behavior and at worst a bug.\nRepro: https://gist.github.com/metaphira/b47a7752e2fb5473c74b8f7f37ce61e3",
